<title>USA: StreamLogic says to be delisted June 25.</title>
<headline>StreamLogic says to be delisted June 25.</headline>
<dateline>MENLO PARK, Calif. 1997-06-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>StreamLogic Corp said Wednesday the Nasdaq Stock Market has accelerated the date for its delisting to today from June 27.</p>
<p>The company said it is being delisted because of its stock price, market capitalization and net tangible assets are to low for Nasdaq inclusion.</p>
</text>
